      "worked_solution": "Multiplying the matrices using the usual method, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =[\\begin{aligned}2-3\\text{i} & \\text{i} \\\\ 3 & -1-\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}2\\text{i} & 5 \\\\ 1-4\\text{i} & 2+\\text{i}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}(2-3\\text{i})\\cdot 2\\text{i}+\\text{i}\\cdot (1-4\\text{i}) & (2-3\\text{i})\\cdot 5+\\text{i}\\cdot (2+\\text{i}) \\\\ 3\\cdot 2\\text{i}+(-1-\\text{i})(1-4\\text{i}) & 3\\cdot 5+(-1-\\text{i})(2+\\text{i})\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}(4\\text{i}+6)+(\\text{i}+4) & (10-15\\text{i})+(2\\text{i}-1) \\\\ 6\\text{i}+(-5+3\\text{i}) & 15+(-1-3\\text{i})\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}10+5\\text{i} & 9-13\\text{i} \\\\ -5+9\\text{i} & 14-3\\text{i}\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$",
